# === Calibration lookup tables: regenerated, not versioned ===
# 7.6 MB each, rewritten by Peak Detection (Calibration.py, via
# FileStorage.TXT_sweeps_save) and specific to the crystal actually mounted, so
# versioning them only produced 200 000 lines of churn per acquisition. A fresh
# clone gets them by running Peak Detection - step 5 of the Quick Start - which is
# required anyway before any measurement.
software/openQCM/Calibration_5MHz.txt
software/openQCM/Calibration_10MHz.txt

# === Raw sweep test datasets (peak-detection prototypes only) ===
# NB: the sweep_data/*.txt files read by the Raw Data view stay versioned.
research/peak-detection/**/*.txt

